WEBVTT

00:51:27.996 --> 00:51:31.204
There I am. And Toni Morrison's beloved.
There I am.

00:51:31.204 --> 00:51:33.454
And you know, Mary Oliver's poem.

00:51:33.454 --> 00:51:37.579
So, yeah, you know, I didn't intend
for those things to be self-help

00:51:37.579 --> 00:51:40.413
and frankly, even sugar when when terrible
, beautiful things came out,

00:51:40.413 --> 00:51:43.871
I was like it was in the self-help section
of many books or so I was like,

00:51:43.871 --> 00:51:47.746
what? What? So I think of myself
as an accidental self-help writer

00:51:47.954 --> 00:51:51.371
because of course, of course, dear
sugar columns are self-help.

00:51:51.704 --> 00:51:53.871
And yet what they also are is literature.

00:51:54.038 --> 00:51:56.413
Yes, I understand you've been at

00:51:56.413 --> 00:52:00.288
a sort of crossroads now is different
opportunities have come your way weighing